``` SR-08 | Role and Capability Changes: Privilege Escalation
    Interpretation and RCA: Splunk Administrator Field Manual (Gaurav Malik),
    entry SR-08. https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HRXCT384

    Run on: SH for the change history.
    Query: Current holders of escalation-grade capabilities (SH-local)
    If this returns nothing, run probes/SR-08-probe.spl,
    probes/SR-08-probe-rest.spl to confirm the data it reads exists here.
```
| rest splunk_server=local /services/authorization/roles count=0
| eval caps=mvappend(capabilities, imported_capabilities)
| eval risky=mvfilter(in(caps, "admin_all_objects", "edit_roles",
                          "edit_user", "change_authentication", "can_delete",
                          "edit_tokens_all", "install_apps",
                          "edit_authentication_extensions"))
| where isnotnull(risky)
| rename title as role
| table role risky imported_roles
